<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai to invest 400 bln won in transmissions.</title>
<headline>Hyundai to invest 400 bln won in transmissions.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Space and Aircraft Co said on Thursday it would invest 400 billion won by the year 2000 for development and production of transmissions for automobiles and aircrafts.</p>
<p>The unlisted unit of Hyundai Group said it planned to achieve 600 billion won in transmission sales by 2000 and one trillion won by 2005, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Hyundai said it hoped to become one of the world's top transmission manufacturers in the future.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
